{"name":"Butterbeer","hex":"#af7934","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Fictional universe of Harry Potter","blocks":[{"text":"The fictional universe of the Harry Potter series of novels contains two distinct societies: the \"wizarding world\" and the \"Muggle world\". The term \"Muggle world\" refers to a society inhabited by non-magical humans (\"Muggles\"), while the term \"wizarding world\" refers to a society of wizards that live parallel to Muggles. The wizarding world is described as a veiled society wherein magic is commonly used and practised; the wizards live in self-enforced seclusion and hide their abilities from Muggles. The novels are set in 1990s Britain, which contains both Muggle and wizard communities. Any new works taking place in this universe are released under the Wizarding World brand."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fictional_universe_of_Harry_Potter","wikidata":"Q5410773"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Orange 002 2014 03 19","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Orange_002_2014_03_19.jpg/500px-Orange_002_2014_03_19.jpg","ratio":1.619781631342325,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Orange_002_2014_03_19.jpg","share":0.13875},{"title":"Wizarding World of Harry Potter - Hog's Head beer (5013551487)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Wizarding_World_of_Harry_Potter_-_Hog%27s_Head_beer_%285013551487%29.jpg/500px-Wizarding_World_of_Harry_Potter_-_Hog%27s_Head_beer_%285013551487%29.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wizarding_World_of_Harry_Potter_-_Hog%27s_Head_beer_(5013551487).jpg","share":0.094375},{"title":"Oranges - whole-halved-segment","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Oranges_-_whole-halved-segment.jpg/500px-Oranges_-_whole-halved-segment.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Oranges_-_whole-halved-segment.jpg","share":